Subject: [PATCH] Allow non-ASCII letters and digits in unquoted arguments

Port of Winds-Studio/Leaf dde98e918ab9338fde5c14467c7e0522e4bd9dae
(Leaf 0314). Use the existing Mili command configuration; default off.
Brigadier is MIT, copyright Microsoft Corporation. See bundled notices.

diff --git a/com/mojang/brigadier/StringReader.java b/com/mojang/brigadier/StringReader.java
index c1465df63a48e08ec9ccd6889be4f2f8d13d7552..9a762fb4c38f64f015dbfd96c37e660893fddab3 100644
--- a/com/mojang/brigadier/StringReader.java
+++ b/com/mojang/brigadier/StringReader.java
@@ -171,7 +171,8 @@
             || c >= 'A' && c <= 'Z'
             || c >= 'a' && c <= 'z'
             || c == '_' || c == '-'
-            || c == '.' || c == '+';
+            || c == '.' || c == '+'
+            || (fun.bm.mili.config.modules.experiment.CommandConfig.allowNonAsciiUnquotedString && Character.isLetterOrDigit(c));
     }
 
     public String readUnquotedString() {
